    "title": "Express percentages with 百分之",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-numbers-p04-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Express percentages with 百分之",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "百 分之 places the denominator before the numerator: 百 分之三十 means thirty percent. It does not mean thirty divided by one hundred in reverse order.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "百分之三十。",
                "pinyin": "bǎi fēnzhī sān shí 。",
                "meaning": "Thirty percent.",
                "audio": "31d74cf5552b560563c143b9439e1697152130b1ac2ab4619f311a272e143038"
              },
              {
                "text": "百分之五十的人来了。",
                "pinyin": "bǎi fēnzhī wǔ shí de rén lái le 。",
                "meaning": "Fifty percent of the people came.",
                "audio": "2bdf406858c9ffd79b9a9445c00af9870d5bcb4e4b8f367706695a607b23188c"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
            "examples": [
